# Phase 20d break tests — cost-check and rates-check
#
# Two new gates, both broken on purpose before either was trusted. The controls
# are the first and last runs of each block, and one defect below did NOT test
# what it was aimed at - that is recorded where it happened rather than tidied
# away.
#
# The offline block ran in the chat session's own clone; the last two entries
# ran on the devbox, because they need the captured rate table that cannot be
# fetched from the sandbox (its egress allowlist has no route to AWS pricing).

