# NOTE on the rates block: every refusal above the last two was measured while
# the table was still missing, so each of those runs carries the missing-table
# finding as well as its own. That is honest but it is not a control - a gate
# with two findings cannot show that the FIRST one fired for the reason claimed.
# The green control above, taken after the capture, is what closes that gap, and
# it is the only run in this file where rates-check has ever been green.
